---
source: tests/surface_snapshots.rs
expression: "help(&[verb])"
---
Bring an existing markdown file into the vault

Usage: mnemex adopt [OPTIONS] --kind <KIND> <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  The markdown file to adopt. A stray file in a vault folder is moved, any other copied

Options:
      --kind <KIND>        The kind, which is the folder it lands in
      --project <PROJECT>  The project this note belongs to
      --status <STATUS>    The status, for plan and adr
      --tag <TAG>          A tag. Repeat for more
      --ref <URL>          A work-item URL. Repeat for more
  -h, --help               Print help
